<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#Consignee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Role of an Agent that receives the Shipment of the Procurement (service, goods or works) and who is taking possession. Additional information: The Role is carried out by the Customer or on behalf of the Customer. The possession of the goods does not necessary imply ownership. The Consignee may be the end-user or the beneficiary. (Consignee) Definition from PEPPOL Despatch: The Consignee is the person or Organisation to which the products will be shipped and who is taking possession. The Role is carried out by the Customer or on behalf of the Customer."@en .
