<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#OrderLine> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Details concerning a given unit of goods, services or works requested in the Order. Additional information: In general, an Order Line contains the Quantity and Price of the goods, services and goods requested in the Order. However, in certain cases, the Price may not be known, as the Price may fluctuate from one day to the other."@en .
